    "preamble": "Shivmangal vs State Of U.P. And Another on 14 October, 2025 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad Neutral Citation No. - 2025:Ahc:183708 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad Application U/S 528 Bnss No. - 38607 of 2025 Shivmangal .....Applicant(s) Versus State of U.P. and Another .....Opposite Party(s) Counsel for Applicant(s) : Nitin Pal, Shivam Kumar Pal, Shobhit Sharma Counsel for Opposite Party(s)",
    "facts": "2. This application has been filed by applicant for quashing the impugned summoning order dated 27.10.1995 passed by Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate, 1st, Allahabad and N.B.W. order dated 01.03.2025 issued against applicant due to non appearance in Case No.3583 of 1995 (State Vs. Shivmangal Pal), under Section 7/16 Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954, Police Station-Holagarh, District Allahabad as well as entire proceeding of Case No. 3583 of 1995 (State Vs. Shivmangal Pal) under Section 7/16 Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954, Police Station Holagarh, District Allahabad, pending before the court of Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate-2, Allahabad.",
    "arguments": "5. Learned counsel for the applicant submits that applicant is a senior citizen aged about 75 years and as a result of the same applicant could not appear before the trial court.",
